# Ignored for the 1.6 release on 2026-10-08. Each entry is unreachable in this service as
# deployed; the dependency bumps follow under the dependency-update process.
#
# encryptor runs as a localhost sidecar; its gRPC port is reached only by the pod it sits in.

# golang.org/x/net v0.48.0 — 5 (HIGH), fixed in 0.53.0, 0.55.0, 0.56.0. Not reachable: no HTML is parsed, and HTTP/2 and DNS handling only face in-cluster peers.
