#   CVE-2026-39821 — golang.org/x/net/idna: golang: net/http: golang.org/x/net/idna: Privilege escalation via i
#   CVE-2026-46600 — golang.org/x/net/dns/dnsmessage: golang.org/x/net/dns/dnsmessage: Denial of Service via in
CVE-2026-25681
CVE-2026-27136
